 full NTK matrix moves. I’m now auditing the only heavy external theorem from its primary full text and stress-testing the width-to-continuous-time bridge separately; that is where the validity question ultimately turns.\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"},{\"type\":\"subAgentActivity\",\"id\":\"call_C1crFGCPk35TJr0gDfIdJCwj\",\"kind\":\"interacted\",\"agentThreadId\":\"01a044b8-ee23-7f00-8e58-95f150acd373\",\"agentPath\":\"/root/audit_response_operator\"},{\"type\":\"webSearch\",\"id\":\"exec-1dd72b48-f4aa-4da9-b36d-5c7b50501c62\",\"query\":\"Qiyang Han Entrywise dynamics and universality of general first order methods Annals Statistics 2025 pdf ...\",\"action\":{\"type\":\"search\",\"query\":null,\"queries\":[\"Qiyang Han Entrywise dynamics and universality of general first order methods Annals Statistics 2025 pdf\",\"site:projecteuclid.org Qiyang Han first order methods Annals Statistics 53 1783 1807\",\"site:arxiv.org 2406.19061 Qiyang Han version\"]}},{\"type\":\"webSearch\",\"id\":\"exec-793d915e-f629-4db5-8a58-66b7a4ee4e7f\",\"query\":\"https://projecteuclid.org/journals/annals-of-statistics/volume-53/issue-4/Entrywise-dynamics-and-universality-of-general-first-order-methods/10.1214/25-AOS2544.full\",\"action\":{\"type\":\"openPage\",\"url\":\"https://projecteuclid.org/journals/annals-of-statistics/volume-53/issue-4/Entrywise-dynamics-and-universality-of-general-first-order-methods/10.1214/25-AOS2544.full\"}},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"id\":\"item-1406\",\"summary\":[\"**Planning alternative PDF download methods**\"],\"content\":[]},{\"type\":\"webSearch\",\"id\":\"exec-78635f8c-bad7-4d0c-a81f-23d549c35bb7\",\"query\":\"\",\"action\":{\"type\":\"other\"}},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"id\":\"item-1407\",\"summary\":[\"**Searching direct PDF URLs**\"],\"content\":[]},{\"type\":\"webSearch\",\"id\":\"exec-72290bb0-43ed-41ca-b057-312b66755cb0\",\"query\":\"\\\"25-AOS2544.pdf\\\" ...\",\"action\":{\"type\":\"search\",\"query\":null,\"queries\":[\"\\\"25-AOS2544.pdf\\\"\",\"\\